    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always copy as plain text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终以纯文本复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An open-source clipboard manager for macOS.\nAll data stays on this Mac and is never sent to a third-party server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源的 macOS 剪贴板管理工具。\n所有数据仅保存在本机，不会发送到任何第三方服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any folder all of your devices share works — for example a folder inside iCloud Drive, or a company drive. Paster keeps its files in a Paster subfolder and can only reach the folder you pick here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意多台设备都能共享的文件夹皆可，例如 iCloud Drive 里的某个文件夹或公司共享盘。Paster 会把自己的文件放在其中的 Paster 子文件夹里，且只能访问你在此选定的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything you copy shows up here automatically": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制任何内容后会自动出现在这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies when you press Return. ⌥↩ always copies as plain text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按回车时生效。⌥↩ 始终以纯文本复制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default your clipboard history and Pinboards sync between your Macs through iCloud Drive (iCloud Drive/Paster/). The data only ever passes through your own iCloud — Paster never touches a third-party server. Deletions are not propagated across devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认经由 iCloud Drive（iCloud Drive/Paster/）在你的多台 Mac 之间同步剪贴板历史与 Pinboard。数据只经过你自己的 iCloud，Paster 不接触任何第三方服务器。删除操作不跨设备传播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing the sync method takes effect after you restart Paster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改同步方式后需要重启 Paster 才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
