    "Paster Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paster 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paster is using the local database only, so nothing was lost. Fix the problem above and restart Paster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paster 正在只使用本地数据库，数据一条都没有丢失。解决上面的问题后重启 Paster 即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paster lives in the menu bar (the clipboard icon in the top-right corner).\n\n• Press %@ anytime to bring up the clipboard panel\n• Everything you copy is saved automatically — type to search\n• Select an item and press Return to put it back on the clipboard, then paste it with ⌘V\n• Open Settings by right-clicking the menu bar icon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paster 已在菜单栏常驻运行（右上角剪贴板图标）。\n\n• 按 %@ 随时呼出剪贴板面板\n• 复制过的内容会自动记录，输入即可搜索\n• 选中条目回车即可放回剪贴板，再按 ⌘V 粘贴\n• 右键菜单栏图标即可打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paster lives in the menu bar (the clipboard icon in the top-right corner).\n\n• Press %@ anytime to bring up the clipboard panel\n• Everything you copy is saved automatically — type to search\n• Select an item and press Return to put it back on the clipboard, then paste it with ⌘V\n• Open Settings from the gear in the panel, or by right-clicking the menu bar icon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paster 已在菜单栏常驻运行（右上角剪贴板图标）。\n\n• 按 %@ 随时呼出剪贴板面板\n• 复制过的内容会自动记录，输入即可搜索\n• 选中条目回车即可放回剪贴板，再按 ⌘V 粘贴\n• 点击面板右上角的齿轮，或右键菜单栏图标，即可打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paster lost access to the sync folder. Choose it again below to resume syncing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paster 已失去对同步文件夹的访问权限。请在下方重新选择该文件夹以恢复同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
