    "Welcome to Paster": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Paster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the limit is exceeded, the oldest unpinned entries are removed automatically. Anything pinned to a Pinboard is unaffected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出上限时最旧的未固定记录会被自动清理，固定到 Pinboard 的内容不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard history and Pinboards sync between your Macs through the folder you chose. The data only ever passes through your own storage — Paster never touches a third-party server. Deletions are not propagated across devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经由你选定的文件夹在你的多台 Mac 之间同步剪贴板历史与 Pinboard。数据只经过你自己的存储，Paster 不接触任何第三方服务器。删除操作不跨设备传播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard history stays on this Mac only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板历史只保存在这台 Mac 上，不做任何同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 账号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Drive is not enabled on this Mac. Turn it on in System Settings → click your name → iCloud, or point Paster at a custom sync folder below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 未启用 iCloud Drive。可在 系统设置 → 点按你的姓名 → iCloud 中打开 iCloud Drive，或在下方指定一个自定义同步文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud is restricted on this Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的 iCloud 受限"
          }
        }
